mier coup d’œil. Le téléphone IP a beaucoup la cote, ainsi que la téléphonie Wifi."},"enclosures":[{"length":1354902,"type":"audio/mpeg","url":"http://podcast.rsr.ch/media/capsule/20061205-salon-telecom-2007.mp3"}],"expirationDate":null,"foreignMarkup":["<itunes:author xmlns:itunes=\\"http://www.itunes.com/DTDs/Podcast-1.0.dtd\\">RSR - La 1ère</itunes:author>","<itunes:duration xmlns:itunes=\\"http://www.itunes.com/DTDs/Podcast-1.0.dtd\\">00:02:47.4</itunes:duration>"],"guid":null,"link":"http://www.rsr.ch/capsule","modules":[{"author":"RSR - La 1ère","block":false,"closedCaptioned":false,"duration":{"milliseconds":167400},"episode":null,"episodeType":null,"explicitNullable":null,"image":null,"imageUri":null,"keywords":[],"order":null,"season":null,"subtitle":null,"summary":null,"title":null,"uri":"http://www.itunes.com/dtds/podcast-1.0.dtd"}],"pubDate":"2006-12-05T06:20:00.000Z","source":{"url":"http://www.rsr.ch/podcast.aspx?rss=capsule","value":""},"title":"Salon Telecom 2007","uri":"http://www.rsr.ch/capsule"},{"author":"Radio Suisse Romande","categories":[],"comments":null,"content":null,"description":{"type":"text/html","value":"Invité :  Fernando Lagrana, directeur exécutif de l’ITU Telecom.\\n\\n\\n\\nL’ITU est l’organisation  faîtière qui planifie et coordonne le monde des télécommunications et des services, notamment de tout ce qui est numérique. 200 Etats membres la composent et 600 secteurs sont concernés par ses activités.\\n"},"enclosures":[{"length":2115162,"type":"audio/mpeg","url":"http://podcast.rsr.ch/media/capsule/20061204-itu-telecom.mp3"}],"expirationDate":null,"foreignMarkup":["<itunes:author xmlns:itunes=\\"http://www.itunes.com/DTDs/Podcast-1.0.dtd\\">RSR - La 1ère</itunes:author>","<itunes:duration xmlns:itunes=\\"http://www.itunes.com/DTDs/Podcast-1.0.dtd\\">00:04:22.4</itunes:duration>"],"guid":null,"link":"http://www.rsr.ch/capsule","modules":[{"author":"RSR - La 1ère","block":false,"closedCaptioned":false,"duration":{"milliseconds":2624